              be a monoidal model category, and consider it as a
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derivable+category"} derivable category
              in the sense of (
              %a{:href => "#Shulman11"}> Shulman 11, section 8
              ) with
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
