              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pseudofunctor"} pseudofunctorial
              (and product-preserving) on the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-category"} 2-category
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derivable+categories"} derivable categories
              and
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/left+derived+functor"} left derivable functors
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
