                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi V
                      %mn 0
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} V_0
              is also a pseudomonoid in derivable categories. The identity functor
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
