              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/double+category"} double category
              of (
              %a{:href => "#Shulman11"}> Shulman 11
              ) whose vertical arrows are left derivable functors and whose horizontal arrows are right derivable functors; moreover the axioms on a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monoidal+functor"} monoidal functor
              may be expressed using products and double-categorical pasting in this double category. Therefore, it is all preserved by the double pseudofunctor
